*L_00311:
	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s see...'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e7e:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance turned the page.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ×/◎'
	R
	'Today I had free time.'
	R
	'When TADA noticed I got'
	R
	'instructions from him.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Moomin, are you helping with'
	R
	'Rance?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Yeah, you can count on me.'
	R
	'I got this!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Then do everything related to'
	R
	'JAPAN. Bug testing, writing,'
	R
	'everything. By yourself.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Geh!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'You’ll be fine, there’s'
	R
	'already roughs drafts for the'
	R
	'events. Just clean them up.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Geeeh...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Dissatisfied?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'O-Of course not!'
	R
	'Not even in the slightest!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Mhm, work hard.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/●'
	R
	'I finished up JAPAN somehow,'
	R
	'so my hands were free.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Moomin, come here for a second.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Yes, what is it?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'It’d be nice if there was a CG'
	R
	'mode, and character endings'
	R
	'got listed when the game ends.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Yeah, it’d be great if a bit'
	R
	'more was put into little'
	R
	'things like that then usual!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Mhm, then you be the one to'
	R
	'make them that way.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Huh...? Me?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, I tried, but they'
	R
	'might’ve turned out pretty'
	R
	'normal. I tried harder than'
	R
	'with any other game though.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/■'
	R
	'It’s about time to get serious'
	R
	'about debugging.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Well, I’m off.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］'
	R
	'Wait, you can go home?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'What do you mean, can I?'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］'
	R
	'If you think you can go back'
	R
	'at a regular time then you'
	R
	'could be checking for typos.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'I’m working on JAPAN.'
	R
	'That’s what I’m in charge of'
	R
	'for this game, eheheh.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'And I’m working on it alone,'
	R
	'so that’s all I can work on.'
	R
	'TADA’s orders, eheheh.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］'
	R
	'You, you’re just a slave you'
	R
	'know! A slaaaaaave!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'...But I’m probably only going'
	R
	'to have this kind of time for'
	R
	'a week. Not very long, I have'
	R
	'to enjoy it...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/￡'
	R
	'I’m gonna die. Aah...'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'It does look like the diary'
	R
	'entries get more half-assed at'
	R
	'this point. The writing looks'
	R
	'even worse, too...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, it was for my game, no'
	R
	'point caring about one or two'
	R
	'sacrifices like this.'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
