	'He spends whole days playing'
	R
	'them.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'He’s probably an addict.'
	R
	'How pitiful.'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e7e:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ×/＆'
	R
	'I don’t need an N64. I prefer'
	R
	'my games about mustachioed'
	R
	'adults as sidescrollers.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ▼/★'
	R
	'My Super Famicom’s in bad'
	R
	'shape. I bought it on release'
	R
	'day with Mario and F-Zero.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Maybe this happening when the'
	R
	'Super Famicom’s on its way out'
	R
	'is a sign I should move on.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ▼/◆'
	R
	'Nevermind, it started working'
	R
	'again after I hit it.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/●'
	R
	'In this age where Sakura'
	R
	'Taisen’s popular, I’m playing'
	R
	'Wizardry Gaiden.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'But the boring parts are'
	R
	'sticking out more and more to'
	R
	'me, it’s a little unfortunate.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/〓'
	R
	'I’m pretty late, but I finally'
	R
	'played Resident Evil.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'The Colt Python and grenades'
	R
	'are nice, but I thought the'
	R
	'Beretta was the most fun'
	R
	'weapon.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Apparently after you play it a'
	R
	'few times, you unlock the'
	R
	'rocket launcher to use.'
	R
	'I wanna try it.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/＠'
	R
	'I played \"Marvelous\" on the'
	R
	'Super Famicom. (I play a lot'
	R
	'of Super Famicom).'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'I haven’t played an adventure'
	R
	'game that good in a while.'
	R
	'I was hoping for more when I'
	R
	'got to the ending, though.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/§'
	R
	'I have less and less time for'
	R
	'games... Aah... Games...'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'Ugh, the handwriting’s getting'
	R
	'shaky... It’s like he was'
	R
	'going through withdrawal.'
