	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'Cars? I’m pretty sure he’s'
	R
	'said...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'You don’t really need a car in'
	R
	'Osaka. Wherever you go there’s'
	R
	'plenty of buses or trains.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah... What a jerk.'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e7e:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/↑'
	R
	'Got a driver’s license.'
	R
	'My picture looks awful. Well,'
	R
	'my face isn’t great anyway.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/↓'
	R
	'Still looking for a car.'
	R
	'I made a dumb choice, there’s'
	R
	'no way there’s a used MT RV.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/※'
	R
	'Found one! A used MT'
	R
	'Mitsubishi RVR! The color I'
	R
	'wanted, too! Is my luck good?!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, I entered the'
	R
	'contract for it immediately.'
	R
	'Uhyohyoh, I’m happy.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/♂'
	R
	'It finally arrived. Bought a'
	R
	'car stereo and navigator the'
	R
	'same day.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'...I also scratched my car the'
	R
	'same day. This sucks.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/♀'
	R
	'Wandering around relying on'
	R
	'the navigator. I can really'
	R
	'get around! I love this thing!'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/〒'
	R
	'The MT’s tough. I stall the'
	R
	'engine all the time. When I'
	R
	'try accelerating it just dies.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Then sometimes when I step on'
	R
	'accelerate in neutral gear, it'
	R
	'still accelerates...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'But Osakan roads are narrow.'
	R
	'This is like a LV1 adventurer'
	R
	'fighting the last boss. The'
	R
	'MT’s problems make it worse.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'But either way my driving'
	R
	'experience is going up...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'So it’s fine. I can still get'
	R
	'through this.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/÷'
	R
	'I can only drive Saturdays now,'
	R
	'and soon I have to work then'
	R
	'too... I wanna drive...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'When Rance is done I’ll go'
	R
	'somewhere a bit far away.'
	R
	'Until then... I’ll wait!'
	R
	'I can do this!!'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'...What an idiot.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm, still more written here?'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e7e:
	ZH 1:
	'Lastly...'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Keyaki Morino gave me advice'
	R
	'and helped me around used car'
	R
	'places when I was looking for'
	R
	'a car.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'And Nagi did most of the'
	R
	'wiring for the stereo and'
	R
	'navigator.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'It was funny when she was'
	R
	'working on it late at night'
	R
	'and got questioned by the'
	R
	'police, though.'
	\L_00f6b:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks, both of you!'
	\L_00f6b:
	\L_00f5e:
	\L_00e46:
	ZH 1:
	'Did this guy put personal'
